      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُثْرَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A dust-colour inclining to</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُضْرَة</span> [which
here app. means <i>a dingy ash-colour</i>]: (S, TA:)
or, as some say, [simply] <i>dust-colour:</i> (TA:) or
it is <i>like duskiness</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُبْشَةٌ</span>) <i>mixed with redness.</i>
(K, TA.)

